## Current business facts (quick reference)

- **Shop-only** repair & lithium conversions — **no mobile service**, no trip charges
- **Address:** 71363 Thelma Ln, Suite E, Covington, LA 70433
- **Phone:** 985-402-1206 | **Email:** contact@ngcgolfcarts.com
- **Hours:** Mon–Fri 8 AM – 5 PM
- **Lithium:** Professional Kits only (36V/48V/MINI/72V/150AH) — NGC Conversion line discontinued. Customer-facing kit = LiFePO4 battery, charger, monitor. Vatrer packs; inspect, test, and tune every install. Convenience package `3.0-NGC Lithium Conversion Convenience Package` = $599 + tax. No EcoBoost unless that exact line is on the live estimate.
- **Warranty:** 5-year full replacement battery + BMS. Lithium kit/warranty/convenience replies: no shop phone; close Thanks / Neighborhood Golf Carts team. Do not invent turnaround unless asked.
- **Diagnostic:** $179 — not waived; applies toward repair on known-issue jobs. No separate minimum service charge — bill that work as diagnostic.
- **Pickup/delivery:** Free within 40 mi Northshore; **$99** flat outside 40 mi or Southshore
- **No cart sales or rentals** yet
- **HCP pickup/drop-off queue:** Call for work → send estimate for approval. If approved, they go in the queue for pickup or customer drop-off. When there is an opening in the slot, we schedule them. HCP stages **New job** and **Customer drop off** ARE that queue. Queue order: go by job number unless it makes sense to pick up another cart in the same area on the same run. Do not say lock a time, hold a spot, or easy yes. In-shop only (no mobile).
- **HCP deposit pipeline (approved work needing parts):** COPY TO JOB → **Awaiting Deposit** → (deposit received) **Need to Order** → (parts ordered) **Waiting for Materials**. Distinct from the pickup/drop-off queue. Deposit before ordering battery/motor/controller. Do not invent other deposit-pipeline stages.

